{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18304130","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18304130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1830413001:1":{"text":"ほら、あの霧呪湖の呪いだよ！憎い人の名前を石に刻んで投げ込めば、その相手に呪いがかかるってやつ。","source_cn":"就是那个，雾咒湖的诅咒传说啊！传说只要将所恨之人的名字...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04BF64DB78F86DC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830413002:0":{"text":"ただの迷信でしょ。いい歳したグレイヴボーンが、そんなのまだ信じてるの？","source_cn":"那都是骗小孩的把戏，你都多大了，还信这个？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86BB92BBE8B7C697","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830413003:1":{"text":"違う！実際に体験したんだ！僕もただの迷信だと思って、試しに自分の名前を刻んで投げ込んでみたら……","source_cn":"不是啊！我真的遇到了！我之前也不信邪，就在石头上刻上了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96225691568F6118","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1830413004:1":{"text":"昨夜、うちの窓を何かがずっと叩いてたんだよ！外を見ても誰もいない！","source_cn":"结果昨晚我就听到自己的窗户一直被什么东西拍！出去看又没有鬼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA41231B4342AA74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1830413005:1":{"text":"ああ、怖すぎる……呪われたとしか思えない！","source_cn":"这很恐怖不是吗？我一定是被诅咒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC311FF2B6C95284A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docum